"“Your headphones can hide noise for a little while,” his uncle said. “But real peace is not just the absence of shouting. As-Salam is the One who is free of every flaw, and from whom all true peace comes. When you bring your worry to Him, you are going to the source.”",
"Hassan still had hard nights. But now, before putting his headphones on, he whispered that dua — and sometimes, he didn't need the headphones at all."
